    TeX -> "\\Gamma_{V_1}",
    Description -> "Total width of V1, Gamma(V1 -> t tbar) of Eq.(2.2), colour factor Nc = 3 included; reduces to ct^2 MV1/(8 Pi) for MT << MV1; about 229 GeV at MV1 = 1500 GeV, ct = 2, theta = Pi/2"
